{"id":"0572b6bbfb593e05","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-four-valued-truth.md","title":"df four valued truth","display":"df four valued truth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-four-valued-truth","aliases":["72-df-four-valued-truth"],"display":"df four valued truth","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.2, print643–644/PDF655–656","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition and coordinate monotonicity checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补齐空族逻辑与信息聚合并正式记录单调性"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-four-valued-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-four-valued-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df four valued truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.2, print643–644/PDF655–656"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition and coordinate monotonicity checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补齐空族逻辑与信息聚合并正式记录单调性"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 带通常次序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(a_+,a_-),b=(b_+,b_-)\\in\\mathbf2^2\">\\(a=(a_+,a_-),b=(b_+,b_-)\\in\\mathbf2^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a_i)_{i\\in I}\\in(\\mathbf2^2)^I\">\\((a_i)_{i\\in I}\\in(\\mathbf2^2)^I\\)</span>。上确界与下确界在有限格2中计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 为信息次序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low},\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm up},\\mathsf{Two}\">\\(\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low},\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm up},\\mathsf{Two}\\)</span> 为下列子集。</li>\n<li>新增不等式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{Four}\">\\(a,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{Four}\\)</span>；布尔完备格约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\varnothing=0\">\\(\\sup\\varnothing=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\\varnothing=1\">\\(\\inf\\varnothing=1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Four}&amp;:=\\mathbf2^2,\\quad\\mathsf t:=(1,0),\\quad\\mathsf f:=(0,1),\\quad\\mathsf u:=(0,0),\\quad\\mathsf c:=(1,1),\\\\\na\\sqsubseteq b&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow a_+\\le b_+\\land a_-\\le b_-,\\quad\\sim a:=(a_-,a_+),\\\\\na\\mathbin{\\lor_4}b&amp;:=(\\max(a_+,b_+),\\min(a_-,b_-)),\\quad a\\mathbin{\\land_4}b:=(\\min(a_+,b_+),\\max(a_-,b_-)),\\\\\n\\bigvee^{4}_{i\\in I}a_i&amp;:=(\\sup_i(a_i)_+,\\inf_i(a_i)_-),\\quad\\bigwedge^{4}_{i\\in I}a_i:=(\\inf_i(a_i)_+,\\sup_i(a_i)_-),\\\\\n\\bigsqcup_{i\\in I}a_i&amp;:=(\\sup_i(a_i)_+,\\sup_i(a_i)_-),\\quad\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{i\\in I}a_i:=(\\inf_i(a_i)_+,\\inf_i(a_i)_-),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Four}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf c\\},\\quad\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm up}:=\\mathsf{Four}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf u\\},\\quad\\mathsf{Two}:=\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Four}&amp;:=\\mathbf2^2,\\quad\\mathsf t:=(1,0),\\quad\\mathsf f:=(0,1),\\quad\\mathsf u:=(0,0),\\quad\\mathsf c:=(1,1),\\\\\na\\sqsubseteq b&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow a_+\\le b_+\\land a_-\\le b_-,\\quad\\sim a:=(a_-,a_+),\\\\\na\\mathbin{\\lor_4}b&amp;:=(\\max(a_+,b_+),\\min(a_-,b_-)),\\quad a\\mathbin{\\land_4}b:=(\\min(a_+,b_+),\\max(a_-,b_-)),\\\\\n\\bigvee^{4}_{i\\in I}a_i&amp;:=(\\sup_i(a_i)_+,\\inf_i(a_i)_-),\\quad\\bigwedge^{4}_{i\\in I}a_i:=(\\inf_i(a_i)_+,\\sup_i(a_i)_-),\\\\\n\\bigsqcup_{i\\in I}a_i&amp;:=(\\sup_i(a_i)_+,\\sup_i(a_i)_-),\\quad\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{i\\in I}a_i:=(\\inf_i(a_i)_+,\\inf_i(a_i)_-),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Four}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf c\\},\\quad\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm up}:=\\mathsf{Four}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf u\\},\\quad\\mathsf{Two}:=\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee^4\\varnothing=\\mathsf f,\\quad\\bigwedge^4\\varnothing=\\mathsf t,\\quad\n\\bigsqcup\\varnothing=\\mathsf u,\\quad\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\varnothing=\\mathsf c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigvee^4\\varnothing=\\mathsf f,\\quad\\bigwedge^4\\varnothing=\\mathsf t,\\quad\n\\bigsqcup\\varnothing=\\mathsf u,\\quad\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\varnothing=\\mathsf c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\sqsubseteq b\\land c\\sqsubseteq d\\Rightarrow\n(a\\land_4c)\\sqsubseteq(b\\land_4d)\\land(a\\lor_4c)\\sqsubseteq(b\\lor_4d),\\qquad\na\\sqsubseteq b\\Rightarrow\\sim a\\sqsubseteq\\sim b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\sqsubseteq b\\land c\\sqsubseteq d\\Rightarrow\n(a\\land_4c)\\sqsubseteq(b\\land_4d)\\land(a\\lor_4c)\\sqsubseteq(b\\lor_4d),\\qquad\na\\sqsubseteq b\\Rightarrow\\sim a\\sqsubseteq\\sim b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书IX印刷643–644/PDF655–656逐式核对。逻辑析取/合取与信息上确界不同，不能把它们都写成同一join。所有显示逻辑运算对信息次序单调；各坐标的min/max直接证明。lower/up/two三个子集对逻辑运算封闭；lower的任意集合信息上确界未必仍lower，但递增链的上确界仍lower。</p>\n<p>本轮将原先限非空族的聚合延到空族，按完备布尔格的空上/下确界得到四个不同单位值。单调性由每个坐标的 min/max 与交换直接验证；这使程序空 body、无 head 子句及信息底的约定在形式层可核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"a=(a_+,a_-),b=(b_+,b_-)\\in\\mathbf2^2","display":false},{"tex":"(a_i)_{i\\in I}\\in(\\mathbf2^2)^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low},\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm up},\\mathsf{Two}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{Four}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\varnothing=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\inf\\varnothing=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Four}&:=\\mathbf2^2,\\quad\\mathsf t:=(1,0),\\quad\\mathsf f:=(0,1),\\quad\\mathsf u:=(0,0),\\quad\\mathsf c:=(1,1),\\\\\na\\sqsubseteq b&:\\Longleftrightarrow a_+\\le b_+\\land a_-\\le b_-,\\quad\\sim a:=(a_-,a_+),\\\\\na\\mathbin{\\lor_4}b&:=(\\max(a_+,b_+),\\min(a_-,b_-)),\\quad a\\mathbin{\\land_4}b:=(\\min(a_+,b_+),\\max(a_-,b_-)),\\\\\n\\bigvee^{4}_{i\\in I}a_i&:=(\\sup_i(a_i)_+,\\inf_i(a_i)_-),\\quad\\bigwedge^{4}_{i\\in I}a_i:=(\\inf_i(a_i)_+,\\sup_i(a_i)_-),\\\\\n\\bigsqcup_{i\\in I}a_i&:=(\\sup_i(a_i)_+,\\sup_i(a_i)_-),\\quad\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{i\\in I}a_i:=(\\inf_i(a_i)_+,\\inf_i(a_i)_-),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}&:=\\mathsf{Four}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf c\\},\\quad\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm up}:=\\mathsf{Four}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf u\\},\\quad\\mathsf{Two}:=\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigvee^4\\varnothing=\\mathsf f,\\quad\\bigwedge^4\\varnothing=\\mathsf t,\\quad\n\\bigsqcup\\varnothing=\\mathsf u,\\quad\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\varnothing=\\mathsf c.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\sqsubseteq b\\land c\\sqsubseteq d\\Rightarrow\n(a\\land_4c)\\sqsubseteq(b\\land_4d)\\land(a\\lor_4c)\\sqsubseteq(b\\lor_4d),\\qquad\na\\sqsubseteq b\\Rightarrow\\sim a\\sqsubseteq\\sim b.","display":true}],"bytes":2739,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-truth|df four valued truth]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df four valued truth](72-df-four-valued-truth.md)"},{"id":"dd6da9fb2b3060fc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"四值及其信息次序取 [[72-df-four-valued-truth]]；$I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H$。$\\operatorname{lv},\\operatorname{bv},\\mathcal T_P$ 由下式给出，非空有限逻辑合取、析取沿用四值运算。"},{"id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-388","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-four-valued-truth|df four valued truth]]"},{"id":"aeeeb6862efb50c6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-four-valued-truth]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-four-valued-truth]]"},{"id":"57199c40d155f4ba","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-four-valued-truth]]"}],"outgoing":[]}